@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam padding 8
skinparam dpi 180
hide footbox
autonumber
participant "Runtime" as R
participant "data.Agent" as D
participant "skill.Registry" as REG
participant "skill.Skill" as SK
participant "外部服务" as EXT
R -> D : BuildState(ctx, data.Input)
D -> D : domain.NewState()\nresolveJourneyIdentity(ctx, journey)
D -> D : MissingFields(state)
D -> REG : Query(ctx, skill.Query)
loop 按缺失字段匹配 每个技能每次查询最多调用一次
 REG -> SK : Supports(field)
 REG -> SK : Execute(ctx, query)
 SK -> EXT : 普通 HTTPS 请求\n需要定位的技能读取 query.Location
 EXT --> SK : 数据或错误
 SK --> REG : Observations + Issues
end
REG --> D : skill.Result
D -> D : applyObservations(...)\nbuildTimeline(times)\nassessQuality(state, etaRequired(...))
D --> R : data.Result{State, Journey, Issues}
note over D,REG : 单源失败记入 Issues\n每轮从新 State 开始 不逐字段回填旧数据
note over SK,EXT : flight_status / airport_status / flight_identity 为 EOOB\nroute_eta 当前调用高德 与仓库本地估算约束有偏差

@enduml
